# SUPER AGENT TRADERS — OMARI GROUP

AI-powered trading platform with MT5 integration, risk management, market analysis, and specialized autonomous trading agents.

## Features

- Persian (Dari) + English UI
- Dark institutional trading dashboard
- MT5-ready connection flow and system health widgets
- AI agent monitoring and signal overview
- Risk controls and emergency stop logic
- Responsive mobile and desktop layout

## Getting started

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open http://localhost:3000

## Project structure

- `app/` — app pages and shared styling
- `app/page.tsx` — landing page
- `app/dashboard/page.tsx` — trading dashboard
- `app/globals.css` — dark institutional design system

## Notes

This repository is a production-style front-end scaffold for the requested trading platform and is ready to be extended with real backend, database, MT5 bridge, and AI integrations.


























































































































































